    },
    {
      "videoId": "3PWtaackIJU",
      "sentenceId": "s0006",
      "text": "Yes, sea levels are rising, but the rise is not accelerating—if anything, two recent papers, one by Chinese scientists published in January 2014, and the other by U.S. scientists published in May 2013, have shown a small decline in the rate of sea-level increase.",
      "start": 28.82,
