      "truthStatus": "not_assessed"
    },
    {
      "videoId": "3PWtaackIJU",
      "sentenceId": "s0020",
      "text": "If you’re rich like Florida, a major hurricane might cause plenty of damage to expensive buildings, but it kills few people and causes only a temporary dent in economic output.",
