      "truthStatus": "not_assessed"
    },
    {
      "videoId": "3PWtaackIJU",
      "sentenceId": "s0021",
      "text": "If a similar hurricane hits a poorer country like the Philippines or Guatemala, it kills many more people and can devastate the economy.",
